eam/apps/3096040/extras/93d447be7f255710f251e7954905cd8c.webm?t=1722618377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096040/extras/93d447be7f255710f251e7954905cd8c.mp4?t=1722618377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Extraction: Secure your loot and exit the multiplayer arena.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096040/extras/f5870ce9fec0fbf1972a4642405e3fcc.poster.avif?t=1722618377\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096040/extras/f5870ce9fec0fbf1972a4642405e3fcc.webm?t=1722618377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096040/extras/f5870ce9fec0fbf1972a4642405e3fcc.mp4?t=1722618377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
